 bastion-free-ami access node
-------------------------------------------------------------------------
 This shell session is being recorded. Keystrokes and output are streamed
 to CloudWatch Logs, and the session itself is recorded in CloudTrail.

 Do not type secrets at a prompt. To enter one without it being logged:

     stty -echo; read SECRET; stty echo

 This host is a transit point, not a workstation. It has no database
 clients by design -- run your own client on your laptop and reach the
 datastore through port forwarding instead:

     scripts/connect --forward --host <endpoint> --port <port>

 This node is replaced automatically and keeps no state. Anything you
 leave in a home directory will be gone when it is recycled.

